    "description": "Crystal & Gemstone Specimen Collection\nNatural & Treated Mineral Lot\nTotal Weight: 12.2 lbs\nThis diverse collection features a wide variety of natural mineral specimens and polished stones, totaling over 12 pounds. The lot includes high-quality raw clusters, decorative bookend-style chunks, and polished metaphysical shapes. Notable specimens include a large, deep purple amethyst druzy cluster, a vibrant blue celestine cluster, and multiple aura-coated quartz points featuring iridescent prismatic finishes. The variety of textures, from raw crystalline formations to mirror-polished surfaces, makes this an ideal lot for collectors or home decor.\nLarge Amethyst druzy cluster with well-defined crystalline points and matrix backing\nSubstantial Blue Celestine (Celestite) cluster with translucent crystalline structure\nPolished Lapis Lazuli palm stone and blue-and-white polished stone egg\nTreated Aura Quartz points and iridescent spheres with prismatic light-refracting coatings\nPair of Agate bookend-style specimens featuring gold-tone metallic accents on top surfaces\nIncludes assorted tumbled stones, a polished banded jasper rectangle, and a natural seashell\nCondition:\nVery good overall condition across the entire collection. Natural specimens show typical geological variations and crystal terminations as expected for raw minerals. Polished stones feature smooth finishes with minimal surface wear or micro-scratches. Aura-treated items retain bright, consistent iridescence. No significant damage or major chips observed beyond the natural inclusions and rough-hewn edges characteristic of unpolished mineral specimens. All pieces are structurally sound and suitable for display.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the